      heading: "CRM → Projects → Invoicing: The Integrated Flow"
      descriptionPoints: <p data-start="1543" data-end="1603">From sales opportunity to invoice, without re-entering data.</p><ul data-start="1605" data-end="1812"><li data-start="1605" data-end="1664">A won CRM opportunity automatically creates the project</li><li data-start="1665" data-end="1707">Timesheets feed invoicing in real time</li><li data-start="1708" data-end="1757">No service can be forgotten or under-invoiced</li><li data-start="1758" data-end="1812">Complete view of the client cycle in a single tool</li></ul>
